A bind that settles a waiting lender but not the borrower it lends to.
The borrower keeps the queue the lender's old units gave it.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a lender's virtual time comes before the release
Report: a place of a ready thread that may run waits on no queue
Witness: fuzz lend-lender-earns

diff --git a/kernel/sched.c b/kernel/sched.c
--- a/kernel/sched.c
+++ b/kernel/sched.c
@@ -648,7 +648,7 @@ void sched_bind(struct place *p, uint32_t first, uint32_t count, uint8_t rights,
             p->vt = unit_vt[first + i];
         }
     }
-    lender_settle(place_thread(p));
+    thread_settle(place_thread(p));
